window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-153-d50fd2a97f1bcbe3.json"]={sha256:"d50fd2a97f1bcbe391181a9e298228f26b1d30b3585f9b96fd8002b1c64001a7",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-941dfb38670077d1","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.709/en","title":"ITU-T G.709: Interfaces for the optical transport network","titleEn":"ITU-T G.709: Interfaces for the optical transport network","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-153","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-153","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-154","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.709/en"],"title":"DP-16QAM：每符號位元與傳輸代價","titleEn":"DP-16QAM: bits per symbol and transport tradeoff","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學服務需至少120 Gbit/s；32 GBd組不足，40 GBd組達標但不代表光學誤碼已驗收。 symbol_ledger.csv與線速/淨速定義表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 102.4 與變更 128 Gbit/s、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching service requires120 Gbit/s;32 GBd is insufficient and40 GBd meets rate only, not optical BER acceptance. symbol_ledger.csv and gross/net rate definitions Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 102.4 and changed 128 Gbit/s, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學率目標200 Gbit/s只由16QAM達成；需另外提出所需SNR與非線性驗證，不能直接批准升階。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Only16QAM reaches the200 Gbit/s teaching target; require separate SNR and nonlinearity checks before approving modulation change.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成32 GBd、有效負載比例0.80；變更至40 GBd而維持相同比例。 名義式 32*2*2*0.8 = 102.4 Gbit/s；變更式 40*2*2*0.8 = 128 Gbit/s。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 用1 ns時間窗列兩偏振符號數與編碼位元，再扣明示冗餘；以符號數守恆核對。","合成32 GBd；比較M=4和M=16，兩偏振同速且不計框架開銷。 名義式 2*32*log2(4) = 128 Gbit/s；變更式 2*32*log2(16) = 256 Gbit/s。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 列4與16點星座的位元標籤數；以每偏振每秒符號數獨立乘回，不把星座點數直接當位元數。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic32 GBd and0.80 payload fraction; change to40 GBd with the same fraction. Nominal 32*2*2*0.8 = 102.4 Gbit/s; changed 40*2*2*0.8 = 128 Gbit/s. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Count symbols and coded bits on both polarizations in a1 ns window, then remove stated redundancy; reconcile symbol counts.","Synthetic32 GBd; compareM=4 andM=16 with equal polarization rates and no framing overhead. Nominal 2*32*log2(4) = 128 Gbit/s; changed 2*32*log2(16) = 256 Gbit/s. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate label lengths for4- and16-point constellations; multiply symbols per polarization independently, not constellation count itself.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-163","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.9807.1/en"],"title":"XGS-PON：對稱鏈路的有效吞吐","titleEn":"XGS-PON: useful throughput of a symmetric access link","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學服務需至少120 Gbit/s；32 GBd組不足，40 GBd組達標但不代表光學誤碼已驗收。 symbol_ledger.csv與線速/淨速定義表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 102.4 與變更 128 Gbit/s、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching service requires120 Gbit/s;32 GBd is insufficient and40 GBd meets rate only, not optical BER acceptance. symbol_ledger.csv and gross/net rate definitions Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 102.4 and changed 128 Gbit/s, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學應用要求8 Gbit/s；0.90組達標、0.75組不足，需另驗每用戶公平性。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching application requirement8 Gbit/s:0.90 passes and0.75 fails; per-user fairness remains a separate test.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成32 GBd、有效負載比例0.80；變更至40 GBd而維持相同比例。 名義式 32*2*2*0.8 = 102.4 Gbit/s；變更式 40*2*2*0.8 = 128 Gbit/s。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 用1 ns時間窗列兩偏振符號數與編碼位元，再扣明示冗餘；以符號數守恆核對。","合成線速10 Gbit/s、框架有效0.95、封包有效0.90；變更封包有效0.75。 名義式 10*0.95*0.9 = 8.55 Gbit/s；變更式 10*0.95*0.75 = 7.125 Gbit/s。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 從固定時間窗的線端位元、承載位元及應用位元三個計數器獨立求比；教學10不作精確標準線速聲明。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic32 GBd and0.80 payload fraction; change to40 GBd with the same fraction. Nominal 32*2*2*0.8 = 102.4 Gbit/s; changed 40*2*2*0.8 = 128 Gbit/s. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Count symbols and coded bits on both polarizations in a1 ns window, then remove stated redundancy; reconcile symbol counts.","Synthetic line rate10 Gbit/s, framing efficiency0.95 and packet efficiency0.90; change packet efficiency to0.75. Nominal 10*0.95*0.9 = 8.55 Gbit/s; changed 10*0.95*0.75 = 7.125 Gbit/s. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Independently compare line, bearer and application bit counters over one interval; the teaching10 is not a precise standard line-rate claim.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-941dfb38670077d1","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.709/en","title":"ITU-T G.709: Interfaces for the optical transport network","titleEn":"ITU-T G.709: Interfaces for the optical transport network","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-63f053269be6eab5","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.9807.1/en","title":"ITU-T G.9807.1: XGS-PON","titleEn":"ITU-T G.9807.1: XGS-PON","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
